{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/10/02/6283971/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から京都に来ています◎\n今回は3日間の滞在です(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はセブンイレブン限定ミニライブ\n今日は全国握手会\n明日は個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のセブンイレブンライブでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのセットリストに加えて\n初めて制服のマネキンをやらせて頂きました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新鮮だし嬉しかったな〜〜♪(´ε｀ )\n見つけてくれた方は\n是非感想待ってます（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに来てくれた皆さん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は全国握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thの全握は今回でラスト\nということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブで\nシークレットグラフィティーを\nフルサイズで披露するのは\n最後だったのかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回毎回\n手拍子やコールが増えるのは\n嬉しかったし楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ後の\n握手会のペアは琴子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/10/02/6283971/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子は2期生ペア握手会以来の\nペアだからなんだか懐かしかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてさんも\n琴子ファンの方も\n2推しファンの方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17レーンに遊びに来て下さった\n皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もラジオきっかけで\n来て下さった方が多くて\n嬉しい限りです(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また気軽に遊びに来て下さいね〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方は\n一緒に楽しみましょ〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！まだ髪型決めてないから\nやって欲しい髪型あったら教えてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#9/25 個握@横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポしていなかったので\n今更ですがどどどっと...！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は握手会が\n久しぶりだったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏に着れなかった浴衣を\nハリキッテ着ました◎笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/10/02/6283971/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部ではみつあみ\n2部ではアップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが(珍しく)褒めてくれたので\n季節ハズレだけど\n着て良かったです〜〜(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部からは私服に戻って\n3部は白のワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/10/02/6283971/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部と5部はオフショルで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型とかアクセサリーを\n変えたよ〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部〜5部まで全部あったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から夜まで1日\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー\n名古屋ののぎ恋\n神宮のバースデーライブ\nせっかちなかたつむり\nアンダーライブ\nのぎ天 生配信\nカメレオン\nANN0\n画伯 新内\n墓場、女子高生\n46show"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなどお話しする事が\nたくさんあったんですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500円貯金の件が本当に多くて\n笑いました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんだけ私に貯金させたいのよ\nみなさん(^｡^)(^｡^)(^｡^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間を\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は明日の京都！\nお待ちしていますね〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#ANN0"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は例え可愛い選手権〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AltキーとCtrlキーを\n間違えるまさかの凡ミス..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オルトかアルトかも\nわからないままな私です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不束者ですが\n来週も宜しくお願いします..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂モーニングゼミナールでは\n中田花奈ちゃんが担当！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスが可愛い乃木坂ちゃん\nトップ3を紹介してくれました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん私は圏外◎\nありがとうございました〜〜(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/10/02/6283971/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何位だろうな〜〜とか思ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんは22位だよ◎\nって最後にいらぬ一言を\n残していった彼女。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか仕返しを！！！！\n待ってろよおおおお(の巻)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは本日も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんブログ\nhttp://www.allnightnippon.com/program/zero/wed/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組メールアドレス\nnogizaka@allnightnippon.com"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LINE LIVEのアフタートーク#27"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://live.line.me/r/channels/231/upcoming/51996"},{"type":"break"